# FIN-005: Q2 2024 Quarterly Report

**Company:** MedSync Health
**Document ID:** FIN-005
**Reporting Period:** Q2 2024 (April 1, 2024 – June 30, 2024)
**Date of Issue:** July 15, 2024
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The second quarter of 2024 marked a period of significant growth and strategic investment for MedSync Health, driven by strong performance across all product lines and the successful closing of our Series D funding round.

Total revenue for Q2 2024 reached **AED 117,600,000**, representing a 33.3% increase over Q2 2023 (AED 88,200,000) and a 100% increase over Q2 2022 (AED 58,800,000). This sustained growth trajectory underscores the increasing market demand for our integrated digital health platform.

A major milestone was achieved in June 2024 with the closing of the **Series D funding round, raising AED 551,250,000**. This capital injection significantly strengthens our balance sheet, extending our operational runway to an estimated **23.5 months** and providing the resources necessary to accelerate product development, particularly for the rapidly growing MedSync Compliance Suite.

Key financial metrics remain robust, with a Net Revenue Retention (NRR) rate of **118%**, demonstrating strong expansion within our existing customer base. The company continues to invest heavily in R&D and Sales & Marketing to capture market share, resulting in a planned operating loss for the quarter.

