### 3.2. Headcount and Team Growth

Headcount grew to **1,150 employees** by the end of Q2 2024, up from 1,120 in Q1 2024. This growth is primarily concentrated in the Engineering and Sales departments to support product roadmap execution and market expansion. The total number of employees is projected to reach 1,200 by the end of FY 2024.

### 3.3. Compliance and Security

MedSync Health maintains its commitment to the highest standards of data security and regulatory compliance. Our SOC 2 Type II certification is scheduled for renewal in August 2024. For detailed information regarding our security posture and compliance framework, please **See SEC-001 for compliance details**.

