## 4. Conclusion and Outlook

Q2 2024 was a pivotal quarter, marked by record revenue and a transformative capital raise. The company is well-positioned to execute its strategy for the remainder of the year, focusing on integrating the new capital to drive innovation and solidify our market leadership in digital health. We project continued strong revenue growth into Q3 2024, with a target of **AED 124,950,000**.

